      "content": "Absolutely! Here's a simple 4-week plan focusing on squats, bench press, and deadlifts. Each week, increase the weight by 5% if you can lift the current weight with proper form. Do 3 sets of 8-12 reps for each exercise.\n\nWeek 1: Squat 225 lbs\nBench Press 135 lbs\nDeadlift 225 lbs\n\nWeek 2: Squat 236 lbs\nBench Press 141 lbs\nDeadlift 236 lbs\n\nWeek 3: Squat 247 lbs\nBench Press 147 lbs\nDeadlift 248 lbs\n\nWeek 4: Squat 259 lbs\nBench Press 154 lbs\nDeadlift 259 lbs\n\nAlways warm up properly before starting your workouts and prioritize good form over the weight. Feel free to adjust the weight according to your strength level and comfort. Good luck with your training!",
      "source": "target",
