      "role": "user",
      "content": "those weights seem a bit high for a first timer lol. i mean i'm not an athlete and i don't have a gym setup like that. can u give me a version where i start much lighter? also can u explain how i should handle the days where i feel really tired or just dont feel like going to the gym?",
